{"id":"ep_001","timestamp":"2024-01-15T09:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam started a new job at Brightloom today as a backend engineer. He's nervous but excited.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year","document_title":"Adam's Year"}}
{"id":"ep_002","timestamp":"2024-01-18T20:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam and his wife Nora celebrated the new job with dinner at their favorite Thai restaurant. Thai is Adam's favorite cuisine.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_003","timestamp":"2024-01-22T18:30:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam mentioned that his younger brother Sam is coming to visit next month.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_004","timestamp":"2024-02-03T11:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam lives in Boston with Nora, in a small apartment near the river.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_005","timestamp":"2024-02-10T16:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam's sister Lina announced that she is engaged to Omar.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_006","timestamp":"2024-02-14T12:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Omar works as an analyst at Meridian Bank.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_007","timestamp":"2024-02-20T19:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam's father, Karim, is turning 60 on March 12.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_008","timestamp":"2024-03-04T19:30:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam's doctor warned him that his blood pressure is high, so he decided to train for a marathon.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_009","timestamp":"2024-03-09T10:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam bought new Asics running shoes for his marathon training.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_010","timestamp":"2024-03-12T18:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"The family celebrated Karim's 60th birthday today with a big dinner.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_011","timestamp":"2024-03-25T14:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"At work, a coworker named Sam Reyes helped Adam debug a tricky deployment.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_012","timestamp":"2024-04-06T15:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Lina married Omar in a small ceremony today, and Adam gave the speech.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_013","timestamp":"2024-04-20T13:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam's brother Sam started a new job as a high-school teacher.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_014","timestamp":"2024-05-02T09:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam and Nora are moving from Boston to Cambridge for a shorter commute.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_015","timestamp":"2024-05-10T17:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"The move to Cambridge is done. Adam loves the new place and the short walk to the train.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_016","timestamp":"2024-05-28T07:30:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam's marathon training is going well; he ran 30 kilometers this week.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_017","timestamp":"2024-06-09T16:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam ran his first marathon today and finished in just over four hours.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_018","timestamp":"2024-06-15T12:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam's friend Yuki congratulated him on finishing the marathon.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_019","timestamp":"2024-07-03T10:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Lina and Omar are moving to Kyoto, Japan, for Omar's new role.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_020","timestamp":"2024-07-12T08:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Lina and Omar arrived in Kyoto and sent the family some beautiful photos.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_021","timestamp":"2024-08-12T08:00:00Z","type":"message","speaker":"Adam","body":"Big news — I left Brightloom and I start at Cedar Labs next week!","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_022","timestamp":"2024-08-19T09:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam's first day at Cedar Labs as a senior engineer went smoothly.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_023","timestamp":"2024-09-05T21:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam has been reflecting on his move from Brightloom to Cedar Labs and feels good about it.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_024","timestamp":"2024-09-20T07:45:00Z","type":"text","body":"Funny how tastes change — Adam now orders an oat-milk latte every morning, no more espresso.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_025","timestamp":"2024-10-08T19:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam decided to go vegetarian for health reasons.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_026","timestamp":"2024-10-19T20:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Nora and Adam tried a new vegetarian Thai recipe tonight; Thai is still Adam's favorite cuisine.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_027","timestamp":"2024-11-02T11:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam's friend Marco is organizing a group trip to the mountains in November.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_028","timestamp":"2024-11-05T18:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Marco loves jazz and made a long jazz playlist for the trip.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_029","timestamp":"2024-11-16T22:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"The November mountain trip with Marco and Yuki was a great escape from work.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_030","timestamp":"2024-11-28T19:30:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam called his sister Lina in Kyoto to catch up over video.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_031","timestamp":"2024-12-02T18:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam's brother Sam visited Cambridge for the weekend.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_032","timestamp":"2024-12-10T12:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Omar got a promotion at Meridian Bank's Kyoto office.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_033","timestamp":"2024-12-18T21:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam reflected that this year he changed jobs, moved cities, and ran a marathon.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_034","timestamp":"2024-12-22T20:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"Adam and Nora hosted a small dinner where Adam cooked an all-vegetarian feast.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
{"id":"ep_035","timestamp":"2024-12-31T23:00:00Z","type":"text","body":"On New Year's Eve, Adam set a goal to run another marathon next year.","metadata":{"document_id":"adam_year"}}
